WEBVTT

00:08:27.542 --> 00:08:31.518
ES: So Cohh, what is going on
in chat right now?

00:08:31.542 --> 00:08:33.476
Can you explain that a little bit to us?

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:37.893
Because my eyesight isn't that good
but I see a lot of emotes.

00:08:37.917 --> 00:08:40.601
Cohh: So this is my community;
this is the Cohhilition.

00:08:40.625 --> 00:08:41.933
I stream every single day.

00:08:41.957 --> 00:08:44.268
I actually just wrapped up
a 2,000-day challenge,

00:08:44.292 --> 00:08:48.268
and as such, we have developed
a pretty incredible community

00:08:48.292 --> 00:08:49.559
here in the channel.

00:08:49.583 --> 00:08:51.684
Right now we have
about 6200 people with us.

00:08:51.708 --> 00:08:55.059
What you're seeing is a spam
of "Hello, TED" good-vibe emotes,

00:08:55.083 --> 00:08:57.101
love emotes,

00:08:57.125 --> 00:08:58.393
"this is awesome,"

00:08:58.417 --> 00:08:59.768
"Hi, guys," "Hi, everyone."

00:08:59.792 --> 00:09:02.476
Basically just a huge
collection of people --